      "writtenOn": "2026-10-14T22:51:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In some workflows, we want to ensure \u0027cold_reset:off\u0027 at the end of flashing regardless of the initial state (to ensure the DUT boots). save_state() currently captures the current value. If the DUT was in reset before starting, it will be left in reset. This is a faithful \u0027restore\u0027, but worth confirming if it\u0027s the desired behavior for the flasher.\n\nMaybe set cold_reset:off always in all situations.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 60,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 60,
        "endChar": 0
      },
